00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:10.720
Hi, I'm Rita Moreno.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:13.540
Welcome to the Best of the Electric Company.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:19.880
In 1971, I became part of an amazing challenge made by the U.S. Department of Education

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:23.290
to the creators of Sesame Street.

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:27.190
Could they teach kids to read with a television show?

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:30.000
Boy oh boy, did they ever.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.510
Comedy, music, and animation, The Electric Company made reading fun and cool.

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:43.200
I was part of this extraordinary effort, along with an incredible cast, Morgan Freeman,

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.370
Bill Cosby, Irene Cara, to name a few.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:52.590
